  description: "If this card on the field would be used as Synchro Material, 1 Tuner
    in your hand can be used as 1 of the other materials. You can only use each of
    the following effects of \"Kewl Tune Rotary\" once per turn. You can reveal this
    card and 1 Tuner in your hand; immediately after this effect resolves, Normal
    Summon 1 Tuner. If this card is sent to the GY as Synchro Material: You can activate
    1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Place 1 card from your opponent's GY on the bottom
    of their Deck.\r\n\u25CF Look at your opponent's hand, then you can add 1 \"Kewl
    Tune\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand."
